          "lines": [
            "Pass! Pass. Pass. Stamped twice, Ines style. Lovely, lovely, lovely.",
            "Big ferry on the right for Stormwatch, lilac launch on the left for Lanternmere. Right for the cliffs, left for the lake."
          ],
          "lines_fr": [
            "Laissez-passer ! Laissez-passer. Laissez-passer. Tamponné deux fois, façon Ines. Parfait, parfait, parfait.",
            "Le gros bac à droite pour Guette-Orage, la vedette lilas à gauche pour Lac-aux-Lanternes. À droite les falaises, à gauche le lac."
          ]
        },
        {
          "if": "flag:bo_asked",
          "lines": [
            "Bo says hello? Bo says hello. Bo never says hello. Must be the pass talking.",
            "Two boats, two runs: the ferry to Stormwatch, the launch to Lanternmere. Passes from the Harbour Office, up the quay. Ines stamps them. Twice. Twice! Twice."
